# README and architecture updates

When this chat changes pipeline behavior, Cosmos publish, retrieval contracts, Stage 2 image extraction, or app handoff shape:

1. Update `docs/architecture.md` (what changed and **why**).
2. Update the owning area README (`shared_pipeline_stages`, `orchestration`, `incidenceknowledgeingestion`, `operationalknowledgeingestion`, or `app_handoff_package`).
3. If stage status changed, edit the status **source** (`docs/development_status.md` and/or `incidenceknowledgeingestion/docs/development_status.md`), then run:

```powershell
python shared_pipeline_stages/scripts/update_readme.py
python incidenceknowledgeingestion/scripts/update_readme.py
```

4. Do not hand-edit text inside `<!-- AUTO:*_START -->` … `<!-- AUTO:*_END -->` markers.
5. Full checklist: `docs/README_UPDATE.md`.

Ship doc updates in the same change set as the code. Mention which docs you updated in the chat summary.
